About the role
At Tesco Technology, we build systems that power millions of customer journeys&nbsp; every day - online and in-store. We're looking for an experienced Senior Java&nbsp; Developer with 6-10 years of solid experience designing and developing high-performance Microservices using Spring Boot and Spring WebFlux. If you're&nbsp; passionate about building scalable solutions, love solving complex problems, and&nbsp; thrive in a collaborative, agile environment - come build what's next with us!&nbsp; 
You will be responsible for
