 - Drive capability development within the team through various training initiatives
 - Ensure fortnightly cross team Product training sessions are conducted to enhance product understanding (ITNM and ITNCM, Level 3, Level 2 etc. )&nbsp; 
 - Drive Technical Level Training initiatives across team to enhance general skills (prompting new technologies, innovation etc. )
 - Lead and review evaluation at the end of Sprint Demo s / Technical Sessions for new hires to assess their readiness (product understanding, level of confidence) to conduct these sessions independently&nbsp; 
 - Ensure compliance on the mandatory Wipro training for the team&nbsp; 
 - Team Management&nbsp; 
 - Resourcing&nbsp; 
 - Hire adequate and right resources for the team &nbsp; 
 - Talent Management&nbsp; 
 - Ensure adequate onboarding and training for the team members to enhance capability & effectiveness&nbsp; 
 - Build an internal talent pool and ensure their career progression within the organization&nbsp; 
 - Manage team attrition &nbsp; 
 - Drive diversity in leadership positions&nbsp; 
