About the role
We are looking for a Senior AI Engineer to design and develop scalable solution supporting diverse Generative AI and Agentic AI use cases. The candidate should have hands-on experience in working on, and not limited to, multi-agent systems, AI orchestration frameworks, RAG, LLMs. You will be responsible to deliver reliable, extensible, and enterprise-grade AI solutions at scale, in collaboration with other Engineers. 

